  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">4/14 window movement; awakening a generation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The 4/14 Window Global Initiative has called us to pray today &amp; promote the need for children worldwide to have an opportunity to experience the life-transforming hope. Will you join us &amp; the other supporters of the 4/14 Window Global Initiative by putting the power of prayer to work for children in our communities, cities, nations, &amp; world? Together, we can be a great, unified voice coming before God&apos;s throne, praying for a new generation of Christ-followers who will transform the world.</narrative>
  </description>
